sf3jswing-jigaxtended (4.4.0-18) stable; urgency=low

  * Sprite
    buffered all IO streams
  * META-INF/mime.types
    updated contents
  * XML's build file revision
    Extension Mechanism
  * GLHandler
    new functions (alternatively switch the projective matrix from ortho<>proj,...)
    impovements
  * GLText
    new implementation up to 3x faster; transform TX handle (translate, scale, rotate)
  * GUIConsoleOutput
    fixed clipsize bug
  * GLFX
    _GLdisableFX switches off assertion to callbacks within a _GLrender call; the code can then
    make stencil, clipping, etc. operations around original encapsulated openGL calls from GLGeom, Sprite, etc.
  * RenderingScene
    new fps counter png
    fps calculation with nanotime fixed bug
    moved _GLRenderTexture* to GLFX implementation
    Console is rendered orthogonally
  * SoundInput
    openAL buffers
  * BufferIO
    NO handle for direct buffers re-use (with WeakReference) FIXED to LWJGL 2.2.2 backcompatiblity (direct alloc caused permgen space overflow!)
  * GLGeom
    handle of GLFX effects (pass-callbacks); transform TX handle (translate, scale, rotate)
    polygons rendering binding switch

